Ensembl VEP rejected my HGVS string (versionless transcript ID), and the alphamissense.org site is currently a parked domain. Let me go to the authoritative distribution points: Ensembl VEP's region/id endpoints with the AlphaMissense option, the Ensembl variation API, and the public AlphaMissense release files on Google Cloud Storage.

